      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**EMAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY / NO PHONE CALLS**\r\n\r\nDoran Estates are delighted to introduce this ground floor two-bedroom apartment featuring a designated underground parking space, now available in the property market.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation boasts two generously sized bedrooms, with the master bedroom featuring an en-suite bathroom. The apartment also includes a spacious living/dining room, a well-appointed kitchen, and a main bathroom. The thoughtfully designed layout and prime location make this apartment an excellent choice for those seeking a stylish urban lifestyle. Custom House Square, named after the nearby landmark Palladian Custom House designed by architect James Gandon, is a gated development offering tranquility in a beautifully landscaped courtyard setting, all while having the vibrant city at your doorstep.\r\n\r\nShannon House enjoys a highly convenient location with numerous amenities just steps away. The Mayor Square Luas stop is conveniently situated across the street, providing easy access to the south city centre, including Grand Canal Dock. Positioned in the heart of Dublin's financial district, the apartment is surrounded by an array of bars, bistros, cafes, restaurants, and hotels such as the Gibson and Spencer. The National College of Ireland is also in close proximity, and the iconic Samuel Beckett Bridge allows for a quick five-minute walk to Grand Canal Dock with its diverse range of amenities. The apartment is exceptionally well-connected, with various transportation options right at your doorstep, including Rail, Dart, and LUAS. Additionally, the proposed DART underground station enhances the accessibility of the area. Bicycle stations are conveniently located nearby, catering to those who prefer cycling. Dublin Port and the Port Tunnel, providing direct access to the airport, are just a few minutes' drive away. This property offers a unique blend of contemporary living in a sought-after location, surrounded by a multitude of amenities and excellent transportation links.\r\n\r\nDon't miss the opportunity to experience the best of city living at Custom House Square."
      }
